WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,370
Have dinner together in the evening

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:04,690
Captain Wu invited me to talk outside the base. I don’t know why.

3
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:05,810
Be sure to avoid others

4
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:19,500
Can I say it now? Captain Wu, I have already said it

5
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:23,170
I don't mean that to you. What are you talking about? Don't force me.
